  "title": "ISic000648. Epitaph for Quinta",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Κουίντα\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κουίντα\">Κου[ίντα?</span></span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"οὔνομα\">οὔνομ[α]</span>  <span data-text=\"ἦν\">[ἦν]</span>  <span data-text=\"μοὶ\">[μοὶ</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πρείμῳ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πρείμῳ\">Πρείμῳ</span></span> κ̣[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"πόλλ’\">πόλλ’</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔπαθον\">ἔπαθο̣[ν</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"τήνδε\">τήνδε</span>  <span data-text=\"γονεῖς\">γονεῖς</span>  <span data-text=\"κάμον\">κά̣[μον?</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>  <span data-text=\"ταφὴν\">ταφὴν?]</span>  <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ</span>  <span data-text=\"δεῖνται\">δεῖνται</span>  <span data-text=\"προφητῶν\">προφ[ητῶν</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span><span data-text=\"εὔχεσθε\">εὔχεσθε</span>  <span data-text=\"θεῷ \">θεῷ </span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al8-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span><span data-text=\"ζῆν\">ζῆν</span>, <span data-text=\"ἐσορᾶν\">ἐσορᾶν</span>  <span data-text=\"ὑακίνθους\">ὑ̣α̣[κίνθους?</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Κουίντα\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κουίντα\">ΚΟΥ[....</span></span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"οὔνομα\">ΟΥΝΟΜ[.</span><span data-text=\"ἦν\">..</span><span data-text=\"μοὶ\">...</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πρείμῳ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πρείμῳ\">ΠΡΕΙΜΩ</span></span>.[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"πόλλ’\">ΠΟΛΛ</span><span data-text=\"ἔπαθον\">ΕΠΑΘ.[.</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"τήνδε\">ΤΗΝΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"γονεῖς\">ΓΟΝΕΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"κάμον\">Κ.[...</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ταφὴν\">.....]</span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"δεῖνται\">ΔΕΙΝΤΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"προφητῶν\">ΠΡΟΦ[....</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span><span data-text=\"εὔχεσθε\">ΕΥΧΕΣΘΕ</span><span data-text=\"θεῷ \">ΘΕΩ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span><span data-text=\"ζῆν\">ΖΗΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἐσορᾶν\">ΕΣΟΡΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"ὑακίνθους\">..[.......</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000648_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag 2018-09-14\" src=\"ISic000648_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000648.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag 2018-09-14\" src=\"ISic000648-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic000648_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag 2018-09-14\" src=\"ISic000648_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000648_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag 2018-09-14\" src=\"ISic000648_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span class=\"line 1\">line.1: <span>Κου[ίντα(?) Manganaro</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>οὔνομ[α ἦν μοὶ Manganaro; οὔνομ[α μοι Kaibel</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 5\">line.5: <span>τήνδε γονεῖς κά̣[μον(?)[- - ? - -] ταφὴν(?)] Manganaro</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 7\">line.7: <span>εὔχεσθε θεῷ[- - ? - -] Manganaro; εὔχεσθε θεῷ [ὑπὲρ αὐτοῦ Kaibel</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 8\">line.8: <span>ζῆν, ἐσορᾶν ὑ̣α̣[κίνθους(?)- - ? - -] Manganaro</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Quinta … was my name … to Primus … having much suffered … my parents made (for me) this tomb … and asked the prophets … to pray to God … to live, and look at the hyacinths.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This inscription is dated to the 4th century CE as the palaeography suggests and is a Christian epitaph for a woman named Quinta. The verse inscription is made up of six hexameters, as reconstructed by Manganaro (1994, 94), who offers some restorations useful to comprehend the meaning of the inscription. The deceased was Quinta, who probably died after giving birth to Primus, having suffered much (l. 4 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">πόλλ’ ἔπαθο̣[ν]</span>, with an epic clause – cf. e.g. Hom. Il. 9.492, 14.67, 21.82 – reused in some literary funerary epigrams: AP. 7.714 v. 5, APl. 641 v. 2) and was buried by her parents (l. 5 <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">τήνδε γονεῖς κά̣[μον(?)- - ? - -ταφὴν(?)]</span>). They also prayed to the prophets to let her see the hyacinths in the after-world. For the image of prayers to the prophets, see the epitaph from Edessa published by Feissel 1983, 36-37 nr. 15.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">498</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li><li> 1994 44.0766 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a></li><li> 1994 44.0738.7 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a></li><li> Manganaro 1994 94 no.7 fig.14 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001825\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001825</a></li></ul>  <ul><li> Feissel 1983 36-37 </li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Deeply incised letters, slightly elongated. Alpha is extended at the top, with straight bar; epsilon is in form of a four-bar sigma with middle bar extended to match top and bottom strokes; zeta is regular Z; theta rhomboid with full middle bar; kappa has full length arms; mu has all strokes off vertical, with the middle strokes not fully descending; omicron is rhomboid; pi has overextended crossbar; rho has rounded and closed head; sigma is regular four-bar; omega is rhomboid but open at the base.</p> Line 1-4  14  Line 5-8  12-13  Interlineation line 1 to 2  10  Interlineation line 2 to 6  5-7  Interlineation line 6 to 7  10  Interlineation line 7 to 8  6  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
